{"id":"brak","lemma":"брак","pos":"noun","rank":836,"glosses":["flaw, defect","defective goods, waste, spoilage, rejects"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dc/Ru-%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"брака","plural":"браки"},"examples":[{"text":"Это мой второй брак.","en":"This is my second marriage.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"second"},null]},{"text":"Я против брака.","en":"I'm against the marriage.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"against"},null]},{"text":"Что делает брак хорошим?","en":"What makes a good marriage?","words":[{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},null,null]},{"text":"Мои родители были против нашего брака.","en":"My parents were opposed to our marriage.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"were","l":"быть"},{"g":"against"},{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null]},{"text":"Тут есть брак.","en":"It has a flaw.","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]}]}